{
  "sn12.65:0.1": "Linked Discourses 12.65 ",
  "sn12.65:0.2": "7. The Great Chapter ",
  "sn12.65:0.3": "The City ",
  "sn12.65:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn12.65:1.2": "“Mendicants, before my awakening—when I was still unawakened but intent on awakening—I thought: ",
  "sn12.65:1.3": "‘Alas, this world has fallen into trouble. It’s born, grows old, dies, passes away, and is reborn, ",
  "sn12.65:1.4": "yet it doesn’t understand how to escape from this suffering, from old age and death. ",
  "sn12.65:1.5": "Oh, when will an escape be found from this suffering, from old age and death?’ ",
  "sn12.65:1.6": "Then it occurred to me: ",
  "sn12.65:1.7": "‘When what exists is there old age and death? What is a requirement for old age and death?’ ",
  "sn12.65:1.8": "Then, through rational application of mind, I penetrated with wisdom: ",
  "sn12.65:1.9": "‘When rebirth exists there’s old age and death. Rebirth is a requirement for old age and death.’ ",
  "sn12.65:2.1": "Then it occurred to me: ",
  "sn12.65:2.2": "‘When what exists is there rebirth? … ",
  "sn12.65:2.3": "continued existence … ",
  "sn12.65:2.4": "grasping … ",
  "sn12.65:2.5": "craving … ",
  "sn12.65:2.6": "feeling … ",
  "sn12.65:2.7": "contact … ",
  "sn12.65:2.8": "the six sense fields … ",
  "sn12.65:2.9": "name and form … ",
  "sn12.65:2.10": "What is a requirement for name and form?’ ",
  "sn12.65:2.11": "Then, through rational application of mind, I penetrated with wisdom: ",
  "sn12.65:2.12": 